\section{Overview}

The platform layer abstracts SDL2 for window creation, input polling, and
framebuffer presentation.  It is designed to work unchanged under both
native SDL2 and Emscripten's SDL2 port (which maps calls to HTML5 Canvas
and WebGL).

The display window is 256x256 pixels scaled by a configurable factor
(default 3x).  Only 224 of the 256 scanlines are visible (lines 32--255);
the source rect for [[SDL\_RenderCopy]] crops accordingly.

Input is mapped to three I/O port bytes matching the Berzerk hardware's
active-low convention: all bits default to 1 (0xFF), and a pressed key
clears the corresponding bit.

