\subsection{Platform Handles}

Opaque handles to SDL resources.  These are passed between platform
functions but never accessed by emulator code directly.

<<platform handles struct>>=
struct PlatformHandles {
    SDL_Window* window = nullptr;
    SDL_Renderer* renderer = nullptr;
    SDL_Texture* texture = nullptr;
};
@

